{"id":"n37550-1-7","stage":4,"title":"굴리다 · 滚","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37550-1-7-1","ko":"저것 좀 봐, 정말 귀엽다.","zh":"快看那个，真的好可爱啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저것","meaning":"那个","explanation":"저것：那个","readings":[{"term":"저것","audio":"/audio/47694f4ba39848866c8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31952","senseId":"1","lemma":"저것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐,","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀엽다.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"47694f4ba3984886","term":"저것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/47694f4ba39848866c8f.mp3","entryId":"31952","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저걷"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7423b70fae543399c139.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37550-1-7-2","ko":"고양이가 털실을 굴리면서 놀고 있네.","zh":"那只猫正在滚毛线球玩耍呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고양이가","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"털실을","meaning":"毛线","explanation":"털실：毛线；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"털실","audio":"/audio/72d963f1a89b57b432aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80451","senseId":"1","lemma":"털실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"굴리면서","meaning":"滚，滚动","explanation":"굴리다：滚，滚动；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"굴리다","audio":"/audio/dfc2b52804e7f18f4f8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37550","senseId":"1","lemma":"굴리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀고","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있네.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"72d963f1a89b57b4","term":"털실","zh":"毛线","audio":"/audio/72d963f1a89b57b432aa.mp3","entryId":"80451","definition":"用毛做的线。","pronunciation":["털실"]},{"id":"dfc2b52804e7f18f","term":"굴리다",